{"id":"161a56e49197d812","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-quadpbopt.md","title":"Extrema and negation of quadratic pseudo-Boolean functions","display":"thm-quadpbopt — Extrema and negation of quadratic pseudo-Boolean functions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-quadpbopt","aliases":["27-thm-quadpbopt"],"display":"thm-quadpbopt — Extrema and negation of quadratic pseudo-Boolean functions","depends_on":["[[27-df-quadpb]]","[[27-df-pbopt]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.6.1","source_statement":"Elementary local consequence for quadratic optimization","source_printed_pages":"594–595","source_pdf_pages":"618–619","verification_status":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-quadpbopt"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-quadpbopt</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-quadpbopt — Extrema and negation of quadratic pseudo-Boolean functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db1311544a44ed95\" href=\"?note=db1311544a44ed95\" title=\"27-df-quadpb\">27-df-quadpb</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a668791f62b82e2a\" href=\"?note=a668791f62b82e2a\" title=\"27-df-pbopt\">27-df-pbopt</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.6.1"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Elementary local consequence for quadratic optimization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"594–595"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"618–619"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\">\\(q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db1311544a44ed95\" href=\"?note=db1311544a44ed95\" title=\"27-df-quadpb\">27-df-quadpb</a>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(-q)(x)=-q(x)\">\\((-q)(x)=-q(x)\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBOpt},\\mathrm{PBArgmin},\\mathrm{PBArgmax}\">\\(\\mathrm{PBOpt},\\mathrm{PBArgmin},\\mathrm{PBArgmax}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a668791f62b82e2a\" href=\"?note=a668791f62b82e2a\" title=\"27-df-pbopt\">27-df-pbopt</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(-q)\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\land\\mathrm{PBOpt}(q)=\\left(\\min_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}q(x),-\\min_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}(-q(x))\\right)\\land\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(q)=\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(-q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(-q)\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\land\\mathrm{PBOpt}(q)=\\left(\\min_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}q(x),-\\min_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}(-q(x))\\right)\\land\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(q)=\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(-q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地恒等式：取负将全部多线性系数取负，因此不增次数，并反转点值大小关系。原书 §13.6.1 讨论 quadratic 0–1 optimization。此等式适用于全部二次伪布尔函数，但不产生一般多项式时间算法；直接 min-cut 构造需要 submodular 符号条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-quadpb","status":"resolved","id":"db1311544a44ed95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quadpb]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbopt","status":"resolved","id":"a668791f62b82e2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbopt]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadpb","status":"resolved","id":"db1311544a44ed95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n$（see [[27-df-quadpb]]）；$(-q)(x)=-q(x)$ 对所有 $x\\in\\mathbb B^n$；$\\mathrm{PBOpt},\\mathrm{PBArgmin},\\mathrm{PBArgmax}$（see [[27-df-pbopt]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbopt","status":"resolved","id":"a668791f62b82e2a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n$（see [[27-df-quadpb]]）；$(-q)(x)=-q(x)$ 对所有 $x\\in\\mathbb B^n$；$\\mathrm{PBOpt},\\mathrm{PBArgmin},\\mathrm{PBArgmax}$（see [[27-df-pbopt]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n","display":false},{"tex":"(-q)(x)=-q(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBOpt},\\mathrm{PBArgmin},\\mathrm{PBArgmax}","display":false},{"tex":"(-q)\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\land\\mathrm{PBOpt}(q)=\\left(\\min_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}q(x),-\\min_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}(-q(x))\\right)\\land\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(q)=\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(-q).","display":true}],"bytes":1607,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-531","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-quadpbopt|thm-quadpbopt — Extrema and negation of quadratic pseudo-Boolean functions]]"}],"outgoing":["db1311544a44ed95","a668791f62b82e2a"]}